{"seq":2,"slug":"javascript-backend","title":"Nim JavaScript 后端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/interop-performance/javascript-backend","wordCount":763,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"nim-javascript-后端\">Nim JavaScript 后端</h1><p>Nim 的多后端架构中，JavaScript 后端是最具战略意义的非系统目标。通过 <code>nim js</code> 命令，同一份 Nim 源码可以编译为浏览器可执行的 JavaScript——不需要 WebAssembly 工具链，不需要 Emscripten，直接生成可读的 JS 代码。这使得前后端代码共享、全栈 Nim 开发、以及浏览器端的高性能交互成为现实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>nim js 命令</strong>：将 Nim 源码编译为 JavaScript 文件，可在 Node.js 或浏览器中运行</li>\n<li><strong>importjs pragma</strong>：JS 后端专用 FFI，通过模式字符串调用任意 JavaScript 函数/方法/构造函数</li>\n<li><strong>dom 模块</strong>：标准库提供的浏览器 DOM API 完整绑定</li>\n<li><strong>when defined(js)</strong>：编译期分支实现前后端代码共享，同一文件不同后端有不同实现</li>\n<li><strong>asyncjs 模块</strong>：JS 后端的异步编程直接映射到 JavaScript Promise 机制</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"编译模型与基本用法\">编译模型与基本用法</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"# hello.nim&#10;echo &quot;Hello from Nim → JavaScript!&quot;&#10;&#10;# 编译命令&#10;# nim js -d:release hello.nim&#10;# 输出: hello.js（可直接在 Node.js 或浏览器中运行）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># hello.nim</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>echo \"Hello from Nim → JavaScript!\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 编译命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># nim js -d:release hello.nim</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 输出: hello.js（可直接在 Node.js 或浏览器中运行）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>编译器将 Nim 的类型系统、控制流、闭包等语义映射到 JavaScript 对应结构：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Nim 概念</th>\n<th>JavaScript 映射</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>int</code></td>\n<td><code>number</code>（BigInt 用于溢出检查）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>float</code></td>\n<td><code>number</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>string</code></td>\n<td>JS string（immutable 时）/ 自定义 rope</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>seq[T]</code></td>\n<td><code>Array</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>object</code></td>\n<td>JS object / class</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ref object</code></td>\n<td>JS object + 引用计数元数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>proc</code> / closure</td>\n<td>JS function</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常</td>\n<td>JS Error + try/catch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>async</code></td>\n<td>JS Promise + async/await</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Nim 源码] --&gt;|nim js| B[Nim 编译器前端]&#10;    B --&gt; C[AST + 语义分析]&#10;    C --&gt; D[JS 代码生成器]&#10;    D --&gt; E[输出 .js 文件]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Node.js 运行]&#10;    E --&gt; G[浏览器运行]&#10;    E --&gt; H[Deno/Bun 运行]\">graph LR\n    A[Nim 源码] --&gt;|nim js| B[Nim 编译器前端]\n    B --&gt; C[AST + 语义分析]\n    C --&gt; D[JS 代码生成器]\n    D --&gt; E[输出 .js 文件]\n    E --&gt; F[Node.js 运行]\n    E --&gt; G[浏览器运行]\n    E --&gt; H[Deno/Bun 运行]</pre><h2 id=\"dom-api-交互\">DOM API 交互</h2><p>Nim 标准库提供 <code>dom</code> 模块，直接映射浏览器 DOM API：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"import std/dom&#10;&#10;proc onLoad(event: Event) =&#10;  let container = document.getElementById(&quot;app&quot;)&#10;&#10;  let heading = document.createElement(&quot;h1&quot;)&#10;  heading.innerText = &quot;Nim in the Browser&quot;&#10;&#10;  let button = document.createElement(&quot;button&quot;)&#10;  button.innerText = &quot;Click me&quot;&#10;  button.addEventListener(&quot;click&quot;, proc(e: Event) =&#10;    window.alert(&quot;Hello from Nim!&quot;)&#10;    button.style.backgroundColor = &quot;#4CAF50&quot;&#10;  )&#10;&#10;  container.appendChild(heading)&#10;  container.appendChild(button)&#10;&#10;window.onload = onLoad\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import std/dom</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc onLoad(event: Event) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let container = document.getElementById(\"app\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let heading = document.createElement(\"h1\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  heading.innerText = \"Nim in the Browser\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let button = document.createElement(\"button\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  button.innerText = \"Click me\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  button.addEventListener(\"click\", proc(e: Event) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    window.alert(\"Hello from Nim!\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    button.style.backgroundColor = \"#4CAF50\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  container.appendChild(heading)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  container.appendChild(button)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>window.onload = onLoad</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"importjs-调用-javascript-函数\">importjs：调用 JavaScript 函数</h2><p><code>{.importjs.}</code> 是 JS 后端专用的 FFI pragma，语法模式与 <code>importcpp</code> 类似：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"# 调用全局 JS 函数&#10;proc parseInt(s: cstring): int {.importjs: &quot;parseInt(#)&quot;.}&#10;proc parseFloat(s: cstring): float {.importjs: &quot;parseFloat(#)&quot;.}&#10;proc jsonStringify(obj: JsObject): cstring {.importjs: &quot;JSON.stringify(#)&quot;.}&#10;&#10;# 调用对象方法&#10;proc fetch(url: cstring): Future[Response]&#10;  {.importjs: &quot;fetch(#)&quot;.}&#10;&#10;proc text(resp: Response): Future[cstring]&#10;  {.importjs: &quot;#.text()&quot;.}&#10;&#10;# 调用构造函数&#10;proc newDate(): JsObject {.importjs: &quot;new Date()&quot;.}&#10;proc newRegExp(pattern: cstring, flags: cstring): JsObject&#10;  {.importjs: &quot;new RegExp(#, #)&quot;.}&#10;&#10;# 访问属性&#10;proc localStorage(): JsObject {.importjs: &quot;window.localStorage&quot;.}&#10;proc setItem(storage: JsObject, key, value: cstring)&#10;  {.importjs: &quot;#.setItem(#, #)&quot;.}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 调用全局 JS 函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc parseInt(s: cstring): int {.importjs: \"parseInt(#)\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc parseFloat(s: cstring): float {.importjs: \"parseFloat(#)\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc jsonStringify(obj: JsObject): cstring {.importjs: \"JSON.stringify(#)\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 调用对象方法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc fetch(url: cstring): Future[Response]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {.importjs: \"fetch(#)\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc text(resp: Response): Future[cstring]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {.importjs: \"#.text()\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 调用构造函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc newDate(): JsObject {.importjs: \"new Date()\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc newRegExp(pattern: cstring, flags: cstring): JsObject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {.importjs: \"new RegExp(#, #)\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 访问属性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc localStorage(): JsObject {.importjs: \"window.localStorage\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc setItem(storage: JsObject, key, value: cstring)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {.importjs: \"#.setItem(#, #)\".}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"前后端代码共享\">前后端代码共享</h2><p>Nim 的 <code>when</code> 条件编译使同一份代码可以在不同后端下有不同实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"# shared/validation.nim —— 前后端共享的验证逻辑&#10;type&#10;  ValidationResult = object&#10;    valid: bool&#10;    errors: seq[string]&#10;&#10;func validateEmail(email: string): ValidationResult =&#10;  if email.len == 0:&#10;    return ValidationResult(valid: false, errors: @[&quot;邮箱不能为空&quot;])&#10;  if &#39;@&#39; notin email:&#10;    return ValidationResult(valid: false, errors: @[&quot;邮箱格式无效&quot;])&#10;  ValidationResult(valid: true, errors: @[])&#10;&#10;func validateAge(age: int): ValidationResult =&#10;  if age &lt; 0 or age &gt; 150:&#10;    return ValidationResult(valid: false, errors: @[&quot;年龄超出范围&quot;])&#10;  ValidationResult(valid: true, errors: @[])&#10;&#10;# 平台特定的 HTTP 层&#10;when defined(js):&#10;  proc submitForm(data: FormData) {.async.} =&#10;    let resp = await fetch(&quot;/api/submit&quot;.cstring)&#10;    # ... 浏览器端处理&#10;else:&#10;  proc submitForm(data: FormData) {.async.} =&#10;    let client = newAsyncHttpClient()&#10;    let resp = await client.post(&quot;http://localhost:8080/api/submit&quot;)&#10;    # ... 服务端处理\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># shared/validation.nim —— 前后端共享的验证逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ValidationResult = object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    valid: bool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    errors: seq[string]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>func validateEmail(email: string): ValidationResult =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if email.len == 0:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return ValidationResult(valid: false, errors: @[\"邮箱不能为空\"])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if '@' notin email:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return ValidationResult(valid: false, errors: @[\"邮箱格式无效\"])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ValidationResult(valid: true, errors: @[])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>func validateAge(age: int): ValidationResult =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if age &#x3C; 0 or age > 150:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return ValidationResult(valid: false, errors: @[\"年龄超出范围\"])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ValidationResult(valid: true, errors: @[])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 平台特定的 HTTP 层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>when defined(js):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  proc submitForm(data: FormData) {.async.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let resp = await fetch(\"/api/submit\".cstring)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    # ... 浏览器端处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>else:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  proc submitForm(data: FormData) {.async.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let client = newAsyncHttpClient()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let resp = await client.post(\"http://localhost:8080/api/submit\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    # ... 服务端处理</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"异步编程与-promise-映射\">异步编程与 Promise 映射</h2><p>JS 后端的 <code>async/await</code> 直接映射到 JavaScript 的 Promise 机制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"import std/[asyncjs, jsfetch]&#10;&#10;proc fetchUserData(userId: int): Future[cstring] {.async.} =&#10;  let url = cstring(&quot;/api/users/&quot; &amp; $userId)&#10;  let response = await fetch(url)&#10;  let body = await response.text()&#10;  return body&#10;&#10;proc main() {.async.} =&#10;  let data = await fetchUserData(42)&#10;  echo &quot;User data: &quot;, data&#10;&#10;discard main()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import std/[asyncjs, jsfetch]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc fetchUserData(userId: int): Future[cstring] {.async.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let url = cstring(\"/api/users/\" &#x26; $userId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let response = await fetch(url)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let body = await response.text()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return body</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc main() {.async.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let data = await fetchUserData(42)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  echo \"User data: \", data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>discard main()</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标准库模块</th>\n<th>C 后端</th>\n<th>JS 后端</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>asyncdispatch</code></td>\n<td>基于 epoll/kqueue 事件循环</td>\n<td>不可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>asyncjs</code></td>\n<td>不可用</td>\n<td>基于 JS Promise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>httpclient</code></td>\n<td>原生 socket</td>\n<td>不可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>jsfetch</code></td>\n<td>不可用</td>\n<td>Fetch API 绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>dom</code></td>\n<td>不可用</td>\n<td>DOM 操作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"性能优化与代码体积\">性能优化与代码体积</h2><p>JS 后端的 <code>-d:release</code> 会启用优化，但额外的开关可以进一步缩减输出体积：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"# 编译优化选项&#10;# nim js -d:release -d:danger --opt:size app.nim&#10;&#10;# 关闭运行时检查（减小体积但丧失安全性）&#10;# -d:danger 等价于关闭 bounds check、overflow check、assertions\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 编译优化选项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># nim js -d:release -d:danger --opt:size app.nim</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 关闭运行时检查（减小体积但丧失安全性）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># -d:danger 等价于关闭 bounds check、overflow check、assertions</span></span></code></pre></div><p>典型的代码体积对比（一个简单 Todo 应用）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Size</mtext><mtext>debug</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>200</mn><mtext>KB</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mtext>Size</mtext><mtext>release</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>45</mn><mtext>KB</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mtext>Size</mtext><mtext>danger+opt:size</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>18</mn><mtext>KB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Size}_{\\text{debug}} \\approx 200\\text{KB}, \\quad \\text{Size}_{\\text{release}} \\approx 45\\text{KB}, \\quad \\text{Size}_{\\text{danger+opt:size}} \\approx 18\\text{KB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Size</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">debug</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KB</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Size</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">release</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">45</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KB</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Size</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">danger+opt:size</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KB</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>进一步的 tree-shaking 依赖 Nim 的死码消除（DCE）——未被引用的过程和类型不会出现在输出中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"js-后端的限制\">JS 后端的限制</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"# 以下功能在 JS 后端不可用：&#10;# - 原始指针操作（ptr / UncheckedArray）&#10;# - C FFI（importc）&#10;# - 多线程 / spawn&#10;# - mmap / 文件系统直接访问&#10;# - 内联汇编&#10;&#10;# 但以下功能完全可用：&#10;# - 闭包 / 高阶函数&#10;# - 泛型 / 模板 / 宏&#10;# - 异常处理&#10;# - 面向对象继承&#10;# - 编译期执行（CTFE）&#10;# - 效果系统\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 以下功能在 JS 后端不可用：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># - 原始指针操作（ptr / UncheckedArray）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># - C FFI（importc）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># - 多线程 / spawn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># - mmap / 文件系统直接访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># - 内联汇编</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 但以下功能完全可用：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># - 闭包 / 高阶函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># - 泛型 / 模板 / 宏</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># - 异常处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># - 面向对象继承</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># - 编译期执行（CTFE）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># - 效果系统</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战-canvas-游戏循环\">实战：Canvas 游戏循环</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"import std/dom&#10;&#10;type&#10;  GameState = object&#10;    x, y: float&#10;    vx, vy: float&#10;&#10;var state = GameState(x: 100, y: 100, vx: 2, vy: 1.5)&#10;&#10;proc gameLoop(canvas: Element) =&#10;  let ctx = canvas.CanvasRenderingContext2D&#10;&#10;  proc frame(timestamp: float) =&#10;    # 更新&#10;    state.x += state.vx&#10;    state.y += state.vy&#10;    if state.x &gt; 400 or state.x &lt; 0: state.vx = -state.vx&#10;    if state.y &gt; 300 or state.y &lt; 0: state.vy = -state.vy&#10;&#10;    # 渲染&#10;    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, 400, 300)&#10;    ctx.beginPath()&#10;    ctx.arc(state.x, state.y, 20, 0, 3.14159 * 2)&#10;    ctx.fill()&#10;&#10;    discard window.requestAnimationFrame(frame)&#10;&#10;  discard window.requestAnimationFrame(frame)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import std/dom</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  GameState = object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    x, y: float</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vx, vy: float</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>var state = GameState(x: 100, y: 100, vx: 2, vy: 1.5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc gameLoop(canvas: Element) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let ctx = canvas.CanvasRenderingContext2D</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  proc frame(timestamp: float) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    # 更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    state.x += state.vx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    state.y += state.vy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if state.x > 400 or state.x &#x3C; 0: state.vx = -state.vx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if state.y > 300 or state.y &#x3C; 0: state.vy = -state.vy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    # 渲染</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, 400, 300)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ctx.beginPath()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ctx.arc(state.x, state.y, 20, 0, 3.14159 * 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ctx.fill()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    discard window.requestAnimationFrame(frame)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  discard window.requestAnimationFrame(frame)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Nim 的 JavaScript 后端使全栈 Nim 开发成为现实可能：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>编译到可读 JS 代码（非 WASM），无需额外工具链，调试体验接近手写 JavaScript</li>\n<li>importjs 的模式字符串语法使调用任意 JS API 只需一行声明，无需绑定生成器</li>\n<li>when defined(js) 实现编译期前后端分离，共享验证逻辑/数据模型的同时各自实现 I/O 层</li>\n<li>-d:danger + --opt:size 可将输出体积压缩至 ~18KB，适合性能敏感的前端场景</li>\n<li>主要限制在于无法使用 ptr 操作和 C FFI，但这对浏览器端代码并无影响</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关于如何在 C 后端上进行底层性能优化（而非 JS 后端），参见 <a href=\"performance-optimization\">性能优化实践</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Nim JavaScript 后端","id":"nim-javascript-后端"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"编译模型与基本用法","id":"编译模型与基本用法"},{"level":2,"text":"DOM API 交互","id":"dom-api-交互"},{"level":2,"text":"importjs：调用 JavaScript 函数","id":"importjs-调用-javascript-函数"},{"level":2,"text":"前后端代码共享","id":"前后端代码共享"},{"level":2,"text":"异步编程与 Promise 映射","id":"异步编程与-promise-映射"},{"level":2,"text":"性能优化与代码体积","id":"性能优化与代码体积"},{"level":2,"text":"JS 后端的限制","id":"js-后端的限制"},{"level":2,"text":"实战：Canvas 游戏循环","id":"实战-canvas-游戏循环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Nim C/C++ 互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/interop-performance/c-cpp-interop"},"next":{"title":"Nim 性能优化实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/interop-performance/performance-optimization"}}